# Update context.md After Every Code Change

After making any code change to this project, update `context.md` in the project root to reflect the current state.

## What to update

- **"อัปเดตล่าสุด"** date at the top of the file
- **Directory Structure** section — add/remove files as needed
- **Current State & Known Gaps** table — mark items ✅ when completed, add new ❌ items for new gaps discovered
- **API Contract** — add new endpoints when implemented
- **Cart Store** / any other sections — update if the relevant feature changes
- **Previous Work Sessions** — add a new bullet for the current chat session UUID when significant work is done

## Rules

- Do NOT rewrite the entire file from scratch — make targeted edits only
- Keep the file in Thai where it already uses Thai; new content can be Thai or English
- The file lives at `context.md` in the project root
